{"title":"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc13426172a93a05eed00b9037cb8bfb8e0876f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)^{1} + (-1)^{2} + ... + (-1)^{2006}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"234\" height=\"19\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/5/ab5c88dd08a078e3c22cc0d0a98b3dc17da5db8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} -2006\\qquad \\textbf{(B)} -1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 0\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 1\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 2006$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"441\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> raised to an odd integer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> raised to an even integer exponent is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110b50bb5249fcb61fa68b2e2716fea319249ca5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)^{1} + (-1)^{2} + ... + (-1)^{2006} = (-1) + (1) + ... + (-1)+(1) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }0}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"572\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The \nUsing the formula for the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> terms of a geometric series, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/a/f8ad2251cf24bc3593f7ae91b023231d7bcc498f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2006$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/7/64751189fd2e55b10c0420624110e62323f79298.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = (-1)^{1} = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/5/14511e151cf5e652f2a07ce850d903404f0c1a97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" />, the sum can also be obtained:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f114b994506abc67d097c82bebc0c1e0c739f354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a(1-r^n)}{1-r} = \\frac{-1(1 - (-1)^{2006})}{1 + 1} = \\frac{-1(1 - 1)}{2} = \\frac{0}{2} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"463\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B\">2006 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</t